data: {"id": "8229b8f9993b4336-thinking-parallel_evidence-679", "run_id": "8229b8f9993b4336", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将补充采集 Pod 的 Metrics、Tracing 和 Topology 证据，以判断 NotReady 的直接原因。\n\n**首轮补充采集计划：**\n1.  **Metrics**: `execute_pod_promql` - 获取 `container_status_ready` (确认 NotReady 状态), `container_memory_working_set_bytes`, `container_cpu_usage_seconds_total` (检查资源/崩溃), `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`。\n2.  **Tracing**: `query_pod_tracing` - 查询 10 分钟内该 Pod 的 HTTP flows，重点看 `/ready` (Readiness probe) 和其他请求的错误码 (503)。\n3.  **Topology**: `query_pod_topology` - 获取依赖信息（如 Service, ConfigMap）。\n\n开始调用：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789087160420, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

