data: {"id": "8229b8f9993b4336-thinking-parallel_evidence-2546", "run_id": "8229b8f9993b4336", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我基于真实工具结果，对 `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` 的 NotReady 异常进行综合判断。\n\n## 实体身份与生命周期\n\n- **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc`，命名空间 `aiops-case-09`\n- **UID**: `705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee`\n- **节点**: `node2` (HostIP: `10.2.0.50`)\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.16`\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **启动时间**: `2026-09-11T00:33:31Z`\n- **运行阶段 (Phase)**: **Running**\n- **删除时间**: 无（未终止）\n- **重启次数**: 0\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45`\n\n## 已确认事实（", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789087238869, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

